// POM2 Windows resource script — embeds the application icon into POM2.exe.
// Picked up automatically by CMake (rc.exe on MSVC, windres on MinGW) when this
// .rc is listed as a target source; see the WIN32 branch in CMakeLists.txt.
//
// POM2.ico is generated from packaging/POM2-256.png (see packaging/regen_icons
// notes in the release documentation) and carries 16/32/48/64/128/256 px.

IDI_ICON1 ICON "POM2.ico"
1 RT_MANIFEST "POM2.manifest"
